From c7af28a066d38604422fc479a48b70810676be08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:41:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 52/55] types: declare what compiler 7.0 no longer takes on
 trust (no change to the built code)

The library was written for compiler 4.3. Compiler 7.0 tells typed arrays, array buffers and video frames apart, and has no suppressImplicitAnyIndexErrors. These are declarations only: the bundle is byte for byte the same.
